 "Benjamin Strober", "first_name": "Benjamin", "last_name": "Strober", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 271965, "full_name": "Selene K. Swanson", "first_name": "Selene K.", "last_name": "Swanson", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 66526, "full_name": "Laurence Florens", "first_name": "Laurence", "last_name": "Florens", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Laurence_Florens", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 513974, "full_name": "James E. Bradner", "first_name": "James E.", "last_name": "Bradner", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 2473, "full_name": "Myles Brown", "first_name": "Myles", "last_name": "Brown", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Myles_Brown", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 1351938, "full_name": "Peter M. Howley", "first_name": "Peter M.", "last_name": "Howley", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127447, "full_name": "Megha Padi", "first_name": "Megha", "last_name": "Padi", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127462, "full_name": "Michael P. Washburn", "first_name": "Michael P.", "last_name": "Washburn", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127469, "full_name": "James A. DeCaprio", "first_name": "James", "last_name": "A. DeCaprio", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/MCPyV_ST_binds_specifically_to_EP400_complex_/5499841", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p><b>(A)</b> MKL-1 cells transduced with lentiviral scramble shRNA (shScr) or shRNA specific for LT and ST (shPanT) or ST only (shST) for 1 day followed by selection in puromycin (1 \u03bcg/ml) for additional 3 days were lysed (Input) and immunoprecipitated for MAX, EP400 or non-specific IgG and blotted. (B) Lysates from HCT116 (lanes 1 and 2) or UISO (lanes 3, 4 and 5) cells stably expressing MCPyV ST (lanes 2 and 5) or a C-terminal epitope tagged ST (lane 4) were immunoblotted (Input) or immunoprecipitated with antibodies to MAX or non-specific IgG. See also <a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1006668#ppat.1006668.s002\" target=\"_blank\">S2A Fig</a>. (C) MCPyV ST residues 70\u2013112 is shown with corresponding substitution mutations. See also <a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1006668#ppat.1006668.s002\" target=\"_blank\">S2C Fig</a>. Residues in the LT stabilization domain (LSD) are indicated [<a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1006668#ppat.1006668.ref010\" target=\"_blank\">10</a>, <a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1006668#ppat.1006668.ref011\" target=\"_blank\">11</a>]. (D) HCT116 cells stably expressing wild type (WT) MCPyV ST or indicated mutant constructs. Lysates were immunoprecipitated with Ab5 (ST) or MAX antibodies and blotted. Red dashed lines are shown to indicate 11 lanes in ST-Input lanes. Identical panel is also shown in <a href=\"http://www.plospathogens.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.ppat.1006668#ppat.1006668.s002\" target=\"_blank\">S2D Fig</a> for input.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 1128548, "created_date": "2017-10-13T17:37:48Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-11T09:32:30Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["PP 2A subunits", "protein phosphatase 2", "RB", "genome-wide CRISPR-Cas 9 screen", "MCC cell lines", "L-MYC", "gene expression", "tumor suppressor function", "15- component EP 400 histone acetyltransferase", "MYC homolog MYCL", "oncogenesis Merkel cell carcinoma", "Large T antigen", "heterodimeric partner MAX", "Merkel cell polyomavirus DNA", "ST", "MCPyV-positive MCC cell lines"